      "cost": "reaction",
      "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> An ally within 60 feet is suffering persistent acid or fire damage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> Gurija summons a torrential but localized rainstorm around the ally that washes off any acid or douses any fire on it to immediately end persistent acid or fire damage.</p>",
